a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0"},{"id":3117257423,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc65zZLP","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested on Samsung Tab S7, Android 13, changing path to an SD card worked.\r\n\r\nI was able to find a code for Android 7-10 to read paths ([link](https://gist.github.com/PauloLuan/4bcecc086095bce28e22?permalink_comment_id=2609277#gistcomment-2609277)), but changing the path didn't work. (see below) If anyone knows the cause, we can create a new PR.\r\n\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\n<details><summary>FileDialog test on MacOS</summary>\r\n\r\nI checked the behavior more closely under macOS with several external USB hard drives; `FileDialog::_select_drive` requires a path and doesn't work with a name. \r\n\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid FileDialog::_select_drive(int p_idx) {\r\n\tString d = drives->get_item_text(p_idx);\r\n\t_change_dir(d);\r\n\tfilename_edit->set_text(\"\");\r\n\t_push_history();\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Code for Android 7 - 10 </summary>\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\n\toverride fun getDrive(drive: Int): String {\r\n\t\tif (drive < 0 || drive >= storageManager.storageVolumes.size) {\r\n\t\t\treturn \"\"\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tval storageVolume = storageManager.storageVolumes[drive]\r\n\t\treturn if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.R) {\r\n\t\t\tstorageVolume.directory?.absolutePath ?: \"\"\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\t@SuppressLint(\"DiscouragedPrivateApi\")\r\n\t\t\ttry {\r\n\t\t\t\tval method = storageVolume.javaClass.getMethod(\"getPath\")\r\n\t\t\t\tmethod.invoke(storageVolume) as? String ?: \"\"\r\n\t\t\t} catch (e: Exception) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\"\"\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"667\" height=\"167\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fbf8667-bc8e-44ca-83fe-97285b02fe1f\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"296\" height=\"303\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d66adf3-bd15-42df-bbb5-13cca4bfa070\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#pullrequestreview-3117257423","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109528#pullrequestreview-3117257423"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109528"}},"submitted_at":"2025-08-13T18:42:53Z","commit_id":"5bcf9a5a57e566f1ef244111cbd748b350299ac0"}]